  "content": "<p>這個模組包是一個複雜卻容易上手的整合包，內含大量槍械選擇、更真實的殭屍AI、汽車、坦克和飛機，旨在創造類似殭屍末日的遊戲體驗。&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/zombies-cars-and-tech-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2版本</a></strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色內容：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<br>探索廣闊城市</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aShgPBr.png\" alt=\"city\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>製造傳奇武器與裝備</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YUKT691.png\" alt=\"factory\" width=\"1519\" height=\"855\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>保衛基地抵禦殭屍</p><p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GzlAZ9N.png\" alt=\"GUNNNN\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>駕駛各式載具</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2fAlV6z.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>擊敗眾多新頭目與變異生物</p><p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oXQmqQB.png\" alt=\"defend\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>我們所有的</strong><strong style=\"font-weight:bold\">模組包皆由Kinetic伺服器託管贊助！</strong><strong>查看<strong>&nbsp;他們一鍵安裝模組包的簡易服務</strong></strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d300\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ffnCEvY.png\"></strong></strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>👉<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/UyKwhyHEcc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>！&nbsp;</strong><strong>社群伺服器籌備中</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#0ff\">常見問答</span>&nbsp;</em></strong></span></p><p><strong>問：如何生成城市？&nbsp;</strong></p><p>答：在創建世界時選擇「更多世界選項」，並選擇「城市」</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>問：會為最新版本製作整合包嗎？&nbsp;</strong></p><p>答：會的！若想協助我們開發請加入Discord！&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">每週特別感謝bl4ckm4mb4sTV帶給我們歡笑：</span>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FKuDI14WXis?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
